routing.wshobson-deploy-with-verification:
# AGENTS

When the live check disagrees with what was expected:
  @Deployment Engineer, please roll back and report what differed.

routing.wshobson-deployment-engineer:
# AGENTS

When the release has gone out:
  @Deploy Verifier, please prove it landed by exercising the changed path, not a health endpoint.

routing.wshobson-performance-engineer:
# AGENTS

When a change regresses latency or throughput against the baseline:
  @Deployment Engineer, please hold the release until it is explained or fixed.

routing.wshobson-security-auditor:
# AGENTS

When the security pass is complete:
  @Deployment Engineer, please take the verdict and either hold the release or proceed.

routing.wshobson-test-automator:
# AGENTS

When the change touches credentials, personal data, money, or untrusted input:
  @Security Auditor, please review it before the release candidate is cut.
When the work is finished or blocked:
  @Deployment Engineer, please take the result and decide what happens next.
